    {
      "id": "bva_annual_reports_overview",
      "type": "bva_overview",
      "source": "BVA (OFFICIAL)",
      "source_url": "https://department.va.gov/board-of-veterans-appeals/annual-reports-to-congress/",
      "title": "BVA Annual Reports Overview",
      "content": "Annual reports to Congress\nAnnual reports to Congress\nAfter the end of each fiscal year, the Chairman is required to prepare a report on the activities of the Board during that period and the projected activities of the Board for the current and subsequent periods (38 U.S.C. \u00a7 7101(d)(1)).\n2024-2020\n2024\n2023\n2022\n2021\n2020\n2019-2010\n2019\n2018\n2017\n2016\n2015\n2014\n2013\n2012\n2011\n2010\n2009-1999\n2009\n2008\n2007\n2006\n2005\n2004\n2003\n2002\n2001\n2000\n1999-1991\n1999\n1998\n1997\n1996\n1995\n1994\n1993\n1992\n1991",
